{
  "borough": "Camden",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed pool and associated pool house, by reason of their collective disproportionate and excessive scale with respect to the context, would occupy a substantial proportion of the rear garden, resulting in the harmful loss of verdant character and green space that contributes to the character of the conservation area, contrary to policies D1 (Design) and D2 (Heritage) of the Camden Local Plan 2017. ",
    "Reason : 2 - In the absence of sufficient information to demonstrate otherwise, the Council cannot be satisfied that the proposed swimming pool would not cause harm to the structural stability of neighbouring properties of avoid cumulative impacts on ground and structural stability or the water environment of the local area, contrary to policy A5 (Basements) of the Camden Local Plan 2017. ",
    "Reason : 3 - In the absence of sufficient information to demonstrate otherwise, the Council cannot be satisfied that the proposed swimming pool would not result in increased flood risk, contrary to policy CC3 (Water and flooding) of the Camden Local Plan 2017. "
  ],
